      "title": "Review before final generation",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image to Draft to 1080p\n\n1. Upload an image and edit the draft prompt.\n2. Run to save a **480p draft**.\n3. Review it in Save Video.\n4. Select both purple final nodes and press **Ctrl+B** to enable them, then run again.\n\nKeep the draft seed **fixed** and its inputs unchanged to reuse the reviewed draft. Final uses **draft_task_id**, preserving scene and motion at **1080p**. Draft and final are billed separately.\n\nDraft IDs can be rendered for 7 days. After restarting ComfyUI, paste a saved draft ID into Draft to Final in a separate workflow to avoid generating another draft."
      ]
    }
